_trash/
ops/

# Brand assets — the Eko logo is a TRADEMARK, not MIT-licensed code, so the real
# file is never committed to this public repo. Deployments drop it at
# frontend/public/eko-logo.png (see frontend/public/README.md); the UI falls back
# to a plain text wordmark when it is absent.
frontend/public/eko-logo.*
